sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User Browser
    participant FE as Frontend (SPA)
    participant BE as Backend (auth.routes.ts)
    participant G as Google OAuth/Drive

    U->>FE: Click "Sign in with Google"
    FE->>BE: GET /auth/google/url
    BE->>BE: Create OauthState (single-use, 10 min TTL)
    BE-->>FE: { url: Google consent URL }
    FE->>U: Redirect to Google consent screen
    U->>G: Approve access
    G-->>BE: GET /auth/google/callback?code&state

    BE->>BE: Validate OauthState (flow=login, unused, not expired)
    BE->>G: Exchange code for tokens
    G-->>BE: access_token, refresh_token, id info
    BE->>G: oauth2.userinfo.get()
    G-->>BE: profile (id, email, name, picture)

    BE->>BE: upsert User by email
    BE->>BE: upsert ConnectedAccount (provider=google_drive)<br/>encrypt + store tokens
    BE->>G: syncGoogleQuota() [best-effort, errors ignored]
    BE->>BE: create AuthHandoff (one-time, 5 min TTL)
    BE-->>U: Redirect to FRONTEND_URL/google-auth?token=<handoff>

    U->>FE: Loads /google-auth?token=...
    FE->>BE: POST /auth/google/exchange { token }
    BE->>BE: Validate + consume AuthHandoff
    BE->>BE: createSession() -> access JWT + refresh token
    BE-->>FE: { accessToken, refreshToken, user }
    FE->>FE: Store session (lib/auth.ts)
    FE->>U: Redirect into protected dashboard
